+ model:'tests/visual/golden/ is committed — it is the ground-truth reference. tests/visual/diffs/ is git-ignored — it holds per-run diagnostics (actual + amplified diff) that are regenerated on failure. You must eyeball any regenerated golden before committing because a blindly accepted golden silently bakes in whatever regression you were supposed to catch; the test then passes forever on the bug.',
