+  <li data-correct="true" data-why="Correct. The canvas auto-places a new block at the far top-left of the large scene, off-screen in the default view. fit_all() (the app's own 'show all') brings it into view, otherwise the golden would just show an empty grid.">The block is auto-placed off-screen at the far top-left of the scene; <code>fit_all()</code> brings it into the viewport, otherwise the golden would show an empty grid.</li>
+  <li data-correct="false" data-why="fit_all does not force a repaint per se; processEvents() right after it flushes paint events. fit_all changes the view transform.">It forces an immediate synchronous repaint that <code>qapp.processEvents()</code> can't trigger.</li>
